{"title":"Technology scholarships","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following list of <b>technology scholarships</b> is primarily for American students.  This list can be reorganized to incorporate scholarship programs in other countries.  Just make that reorganization as clear and as clean as possible.\n</p><p>Additions to this list are welcomed and encouraged.  Please don't be stingy about letting students in on how they can finance their educations!  If you are unfamiliar with how to edit a Wiki and don't have time to learn, please contact <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathew_Crawford\" title=\"Mathew Crawford\">Mathew Crawford</a> using the email crawford@artofproblemsolving.com with the scholarship listing you wish to contribute.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#National_technology_scholarship_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National technology scholarship competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_scholarship_programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other scholarship programs</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Graduate_school_scholarship_programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Graduate school scholarship programs</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#State_specific_technology_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">State specific technology scholarships</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Undergraduate_scholarships\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Undergraduate scholarships</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Teaching_Fellowships_and_Grants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Teaching Fellowships and Grants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_technology_scholarship_competitions\">National technology scholarship competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: National technology scholarship competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_scholarship_programs\">Other scholarship programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Other scholarship programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Anita_Borg_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Anita Borg Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Anita Borg Scholarship</a> for female undergraduates.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.google.com/anitaborg/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=C_I_Host_Technology_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"C I Host Technology Scholarship (page does not exist)\">C I Host Technology Scholarship</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cihost.com/about/scholarship/index.php\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CodeWizardsHQ_Educational_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CodeWizardsHQ Educational Scholarship (page does not exist)\">CodeWizardsHQ Educational Scholarship</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.codewizardshq.com/scholarship/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Michigan_Council_of_Women_in_Technology_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Michigan Council of Women in Technology Scholarship (page does not exist)\">Michigan Council of Women in Technology Scholarship</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mcwt.cusiteonline.com/114.php\">Website</a></li>\n<li>Microsoft <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.microsoft.com/college/ss_overview.mspx\">Computer science scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Microsoft_Tuition_Scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Microsoft Tuition Scholarships (page does not exist)\">Microsoft Tuition Scholarships</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.microsoft.com/college/ss_howtoapply.mspx\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_Economy_Technology_Scholarship&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"New Economy Technology Scholarship (page does not exist)\">New Economy Technology Scholarship</a> (NETS) <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.pheaa.org/specialprograms/nets/New_Economy_Technology_Scholarship.shtml\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Robert_Half_Technology_Scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Robert Half Technology Scholarships (page does not exist)\">Robert Half Technology Scholarships</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.aitp.org/ncc/ncc2005/RHTScholarship.html\">Website</a></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Xerox&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Xerox (page does not exist)\">Xerox</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technical_Minority_Scholarship_Program&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Technical Minority Scholarship Program (page does not exist)\">Technical Minority Scholarship Program</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.xerox.com/go/xrx/template/009.jsp?view=Feature&amp;Xcntry=USA&amp;Xlang=en_US&amp;ed_name=Careers_Technical_Scholarship\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Graduate_school_scholarship_programs\">Graduate school scholarship programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Graduate school scholarship programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.colleges.org/techcenter/fellowships.html\">ACS Teaching and Technology Fellowships</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://fellowships.aaas.org/\">AAAS Science &amp; Technology Policy Scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Department_of_Energy&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Department of Energy (page does not exist)\">Department of Energy</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.musc.edu/specialprograms/\">Nuclear Engineering and Health Physics Scholarship and Fellowship Program</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"State_specific_technology_scholarships\">State specific technology scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: State specific technology scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Undergraduate_scholarships\">Undergraduate scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Undergraduate scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Siegel_Service_Technology_Scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Siegel Service Technology Scholarships (page does not exist)\">Siegel Service Technology Scholarships</a> for undergraduates in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Montana&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Montana (page does not exist)\">Montana</a>.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://students.sae.org/awdscholar/scholarships/siegel/\">Website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Teaching_Fellowships_and_Grants\">Teaching Fellowships and Grants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Teaching Fellowships and Grants\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indiana_Department_of_Education&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Indiana Department of Education (page does not exist)\">Indiana Department of Education</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.colleges.org/techcenter/fellowships.html\">Teacher Technology Fellowships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_Jersey_Department_of_Education&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"New Jersey Department of Education (page does not exist)\">New Jersey Department of Education</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.state.nj.us/njded/techno/fellowship/\">Technology Fellowships for Mentors and Modeling</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_scholarships\" title=\"Computer science scholarships\">Computer science scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics,_science,_and_technology_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics, science, and technology scholarships\">Mathematics, science, and technology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_competitions\" title=\"Technology competitions\">Technology competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_summer_programs\" title=\"Technology summer programs\">Technology summer programs</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018014953\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1578:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 202